{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261006035051_4986fb13","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_2ceef4fbce2d0e5211e3db9a","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006035051_4986fb13","chunk_index":4,"job_id":"mwjob_628fe293634921cb9ab8e651","precondition_digest":"9f14082f8ca9ba3e77613e4c62ca77cff3c65d122f60d56d8ea6c8a1ffab8aa1","project_id":"proj_user_9e58cf742ce8","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_1d61823d229463d2","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_43037496d16c1d4d","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_3e56d14bbfd9677e","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_65c3b624ecca946e"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006035051_4986fb13","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_83e9420f4f9f88b3:full-draft:ec944806ff338668b9c5e162","quote":"治疗策略（treatment policy）：无论是否剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组分析；终点前事件按复合策略处理。","quote_sha256":"7e7b05f63a8eb9008c2ec9f40fabf5d8ba570e08ef95d1d11b82a437157fa07d","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:ec944806ff338668b9c5e162","span_id":"es_01"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心；II期概念验证+剂量探索，KZ-sGC501三个剂量组与安慰剂对照，治疗12周","quote_sha256":"4268ccf092c0fc0128b80142bfe6658b2700494e8122d4e5d9bac2d766363b93","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_02"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"FAS为主要分析集；主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性采用描述统计；次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","quote_sha256":"067b3f77e20da2222b9c91da7106a0b612b21542c62f4e68cae8bb2ae7c09367","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_03"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_01","es_02","es_03"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学负责人与统计负责人共同确认终点前事件（死亡、永久停药、救援治疗）是否纳入复合终点及处理方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_42_01","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划","估计目标策略细则"],"target":"治疗策略中复合策略的具体操作定义"},{"action":"确认除基线NT-proBNP外是否纳入LVEF、NYHA分级、基线NT-proBNP水平等协变量","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_42_02","missing_source_classes":["统计分析计划","既往HFrEF生物标志物研究"],"target":"协方差分析协变量选择依据"}],"heading":"设计依据","missing_source_classes":["非临床药理学与毒理学资料","既往人体暴露与安全性数据","II期剂量探索设计方法学文献"],"proposal_text":"本研究为II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计，设置KZ-sGC501低、中、高三个剂量组及安慰剂对照组，治疗期12周。该设计旨在同时评估sGC刺激剂在慢性稳定性HFrEF人群中的初步疗效信号和剂量-反应关系，为后续确证性研究的剂量选择提供依据。主要终点为第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化，评价时间点为基线、第4周、第8周和第12周，以捕捉治疗期间生物标志物的动态变化趋势。统计分析以全分析集为主要分析集，主要终点采用以基线NT-proBNP为协变量的协方差分析，并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性数据采用描述性统计；次要终点按预先设定的层级顺序进行分析。估计目标策略采用治疗策略，即无论受试者是否发生剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组进行分析；终点前发生的事件按复合策略处理。该策略的选择基于II期剂量探索的研究目的，旨在反映药物在真实治疗条件下的整体效应，避免因剂量调整或合并用药差异引入的选择偏倚。","rationale":"设计依据基于已确认的总体研究设计（随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心）、内在研究目的（概念验证+剂量探索）、主要终点及评价时间点、全分析集与协方差分析统计框架、治疗策略估计目标。需医学负责人确认：治疗策略中终点前事件按复合策略处理的具体操作定义；协方差分析中除基线NT-proBNP外是否需纳入其他协变量；次要终点层级顺序的具体排列。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、估计目标、剂量选择）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_1d61823d229463d2","section_number":"4.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ec944806ff338668b9c5e162","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006035051_4986fb13","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"SMOKE-r5-1W口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC501）：低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd，每日晨起随餐口服；每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定剂量调整。","quote_sha256":"27d2c6ee0aba87aa82c6b4686f544814672a29444462cc6ab5bcd626b5ee1fb0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_04"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"内在研究目的：概念验证（PoC）；剂量探索","quote_sha256":"2d096e242bbd65d0c9236718d79e77a388e84cb9640b99bd47662a6ce8faab31","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_05"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（双盲期）。评价时间点：基线、第4/8/12周。","quote_sha256":"ed3fdeeb458362e8ec2062ccfdb54dabe86146616d3c09971d19582407bead01","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_06"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_04","es_05","es_06"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[{"action":"需获取研究者手册或等效非临床/既往临床资料，说明各剂量水平的暴露量、靶点占有率、安全性边际及与文献效应量的对应关系","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_421_01","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册","非临床报告","既往临床试验报告"],"target":"三剂量水平（2.5/5/10 mg）的选择依据"},{"action":"需确认剂量调整的触发条件（如症状性低血压、肝酶升高）、调整幅度、恢复条件及永久停药标准","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_421_02","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整方案细则","安全性管理计划"],"target":"剂量调整的具体规则"}],"heading":"剂量选择依据","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册","非临床药理学与毒理学数据","I期或既往人体暴露数据","PK/PD建模报告"],"proposal_text":"本研究设置KZ-sGC501三个剂量水平：低剂量2.5 mg每日一次、中剂量5 mg每日一次、高剂量10 mg每日一次，均于每日晨起随餐口服给药。三剂量水平的设置服务于II期概念验证与剂量探索的研究目的，旨在通过平行组比较观察NT-proBNP降幅的剂量-反应趋势，为后续确证性研究的剂量选择提供依据。主要终点NT-proBNP较基线百分比变化在基线、第4周、第8周和第12周进行评价，以捕捉不同剂量水平下生物标志物的时间-效应关系。治疗期间每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定进行剂量调整。统计分析中将对三个剂量组与安慰剂组之间及剂量组之间进行剂量-反应趋势检验。","rationale":"三剂量水平（2.5/5/10 mg每日一次）、给药方式（晨起随餐口服）、剂量探索目的、NT-proBNP评价时间点（基线/4/8/12周）、每4周耐受性评估及剂量-反应趋势检验均为已确认项目事实。需医学负责人确认：三剂量水平的选择依据（非临床PK/PD、I期人体数据、文献效应量）；剂量调整的具体触发条件和操作规则；剂量-反应趋势检验的统计方法（线性趋势、Emax模型或其他）。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（剂量选择依据）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、剂量选择）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_43037496d16c1d4d","section_number":"4.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ec944806ff338668b9c5e162","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006035051_4986fb13","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"按1:1:1:1随机分配","quote_sha256":"72c25373ccda39d122959ebb009159ca899766d2229de691c823ffd82e374382","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_07"},{"locator":"section:随机|block:441|chunk:1","quote":"本研究采用交互式网络应答系统（IWRS）进行区组随机。Part-1 SAD研究、Part-2 MAD研究的每个剂量组参与者按随机分配接受CMS-D017或安慰剂给药。随机分配表由生物统计人员应用SAS统计软件（9.4及以上版本）产生。","quote_sha256":"7e25516aff883ef38cd01d1e5148f546cd19e8736af26ae42a50c4ca7588c324","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302","span_id":"es_08"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:352|chunk:1","quote":"本研究为双盲随机设计，试验参与者、研究者、监查员以及数据分析人员等对试验参与者接受某剂量试验用药品类别属于试验药物/安慰剂均不知情。在研究开始之前由一名独立的随机化统计师撰写随机化方案，并根据随机化方案使用SAS 9.4（或更新版本）统计软件生成试验参与者随机表和药物随机表。","quote_sha256":"8daf6dc46d42155e29ca2768fe326bcf20208390c0e565062d237a9768f12e59","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","span_id":"es_09"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_07","es_08","es_09"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"需确认是否采用区组随机及区组大小，是否按中心或NYHA II/III分级分层","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_43_01","missing_source_classes":["随机化方案","IWRS配置文档"],"target":"随机化具体方法（区组大小、分层因素）"},{"action":"需确认随机表由何人及何工具生成、审核流程及随机化失败的处理规则","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_43_02","missing_source_classes":["随机化方案","数据管理计划"],"target":"随机化生成与审核流程"}],"heading":"随机化","missing_source_classes":["随机化方法细则","IWRS或随机化工具配置说明","分层因素确认文件"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化分配，受试者按1:1:1:1的比例随机分配至KZ-sGC501低剂量组（2.5 mg）、中剂量组（5 mg）、高剂量组（10 mg）或安慰剂对照组，共四个组别。随机化在受试者完成筛选并满足全部入选与排除标准后、首次给药前进行。随机分配采用平行组设计，各组接受相应剂量试验药或匹配安慰剂，联合标准GDMT背景治疗。","rationale":"1:1:1:1四组分配比例、平行组设计、随机化时点（筛选后、首次给药前）及联合GDMT背景治疗均为已确认项目事实。需医学负责人确认：随机化具体方法（区组随机或简单随机、区组大小）；是否按中心或NYHA分级进行分层随机；随机化生成工具；随机化表的生成与审核流程。公司语料中IWRS区组随机和独立统计师生成随机表的描述仅为章节结构参照，不可直接作为本项目已确认方法。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（随机化）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_3e56d14bbfd9677e","section_number":"4.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ec944806ff338668b9c5e162","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006035051_4986fb13","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"KZ-sGC501片剂每日一次口服，低/中/高三个剂量水平，双盲双模拟，治疗期12周，联合标准GDMT背景治疗。","quote_sha256":"2f52a7efb624cb2c790ca99db3e1ba1ab94c309713fee8e3d9d626ff931d1ab0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_10"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"安慰剂平行对照：外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次，给药与访视安排同试验组，联合相同GDMT背景，按1:1:1:1随机分配。","quote_sha256":"be1f2f8d5224812fb65406cf191b819e4bb7668a1995791a1358f3ee011d1fcc","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es_11"},{"locator":"section:6.3.3 揭盲|block:490|chunk:1","quote":"紧急揭盲借助IWRS中","quote_sha256":"60f7f308cc31286e41cd0e263ec3058002ea024fab20328dd9ee9d91a101af72","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","span_id":"es_12"},{"locator":"section:研究揭盲|block:464|chunk:1","quote":"数据经盲态核查、清理，确定统计分析集人群，数据冻结或数据库锁定，此时，由授权的人员揭盲，即将各参与者的随机编号所对应的组别告知统计人员，以便对全部数据进行统计分析。","quote_sha256":"28fc3296e98e7793141221c4f6dd36a810f588fde79cc49c2b03a9aea2a5ec71","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","span_id":"es_13"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_10","es_11","es_12","es_13"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"需确认哪些角色（受试者、研究者、研究护士、独立评价者、统计人员、监查员）处于盲态及盲态维护措施","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_44_01","missing_source_classes":["盲态维护方案","角色职责说明"],"target":"盲态维护范围"},{"action":"需确认紧急揭盲的触发条件、操作平台、揭盲后是否终止治疗、记录与报告要求","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_44_02","missing_source_classes":["揭盲操作细则","IWRS功能配置"],"target":"紧急揭盲流程"},{"action":"需确认常规揭盲发生在数据库锁定后还是其他时点，由何人执行，揭盲后统计分析的衔接方式","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_44_03","missing_source_classes":["揭盲操作细则","统计分析计划"],"target":"常规揭盲时点与流程"}],"heading":"盲法与揭盲","missing_source_classes":["揭盲操作细则","盲态维护方案","IWRS揭盲功能配置","紧急揭盲培训记录"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用双盲设计。KZ-sGC501三个剂量组与安慰剂对照组之间采用双盲双模拟方式实施盲法，即各剂量组受试者接受相应剂量试验药及匹配安慰剂，安慰剂组受试者接受与试验药外观和气味一致的模拟片，每日一次给药，给药与访视安排同试验组，联合相同GDMT背景治疗。安慰剂在外观与气味上与试验药保持一致，以维持盲法完整性。","rationale":"双盲设计、双盲双模拟方式、安慰剂外观与气味匹配特征、每日一次给药及联合GDMT背景治疗均为已确认项目事实。需医学负责人确认：盲态维护的具体范围（受试者、研究者、评价者、统计人员等哪些角色处于盲态）；紧急揭盲的触发条件、操作流程及揭盲后处理；常规揭盲时点与流程（如数据库锁定后由授权人员揭盲）；盲态核查与破盲报告机制。公司语料中IWRS紧急揭盲和数据库锁定后揭盲的描述仅为章节结构参照，不可直接作为本项目已确认的揭盲流程。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（盲法与揭盲）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_65c3b624ecca946e","section_number":"4.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ec944806ff338668b9c5e162","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"6f3a111b5d51c5e61187c311a33fe3333101970480f22cee5c098e6bdbbf9b64","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_83e9420f4f9f88b3:full-draft:ec944806ff338668b9c5e162","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:ec944806ff338668b9c5e162","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:9f14082f8ca9ba3e77613e4c62ca77cff3c65d122f60d56d8ea6c8a1ffab8aa1:ec944806ff338668b9c5e162","text_sha256":"6f3a111b5d51c5e61187c311a33fe3333101970480f22cee5c098e6bdbbf9b64"},{"content_sha256":"d637529e44577d7b1429b2af86b4b1a8f52590a8b92f2e1d83a773ee335fc31d","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","text_sha256":"d637529e44577d7b1429b2af86b4b1a8f52590a8b92f2e1d83a773ee335fc31d"},{"content_sha256":"561c757e6967fae66f0f9d1043dba3e313bd0ee60a03f2c3c8da5efe892b0128","locator":"section:6.3.3 揭盲|block:490|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"dbed66cc1d7b3a","text_sha256":"561c757e6967fae66f0f9d1043dba3e313bd0ee60a03f2c3c8da5efe892b0128"},{"content_sha256":"1541424a072504b13dc999a7346751e32eebb848cc0771bb2ef3908b11c26ea0","locator":"section:研究揭盲|block:464|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"4a27cdd782c3be","text_sha256":"1541424a072504b13dc999a7346751e32eebb848cc0771bb2ef3908b11c26ea0"},{"content_sha256":"8daf6dc46d42155e29ca2768fe326bcf20208390c0e565062d237a9768f12e59","locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:352|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"046677b43d417b","text_sha256":"8daf6dc46d42155e29ca2768fe326bcf20208390c0e565062d237a9768f12e59"},{"content_sha256":"9dcf0050e6908f1bf1781d1b4e78bece680543f7bd3b6d430526c8fa0873ec33","locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:356|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"8b49478f82c322","text_sha256":"9dcf0050e6908f1bf1781d1b4e78bece680543f7bd3b6d430526c8fa0873ec33"},{"content_sha256":"7e25516aff883ef38cd01d1e5148f546cd19e8736af26ae42a50c4ca7588c324","locator":"section:随机|block:441|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302","source_type":"company_protocol_reference_corpus","source_version":"97a2bd7fcf7302","text_sha256":"7e25516aff883ef38cd01d1e5148f546cd19e8736af26ae42a50c4ca7588c324"}]}